    Check acl against search entity (#6492)
    
    Updated the Access Control List checking mechanism to utilize the search
    entity instead of relying on the filesystem.
    
    This change ensures that ACL validation is effectively performed during
    retraction processes, even when filesystem data is no longer available
    and only search index/database table data remains.
